227:            <div class="retrieval-quiz__item"><p class="retrieval-quiz__q">2. Why is an excellent one-shot code prompt still phase-one shaped?</p><details class="retrieval-quiz__a"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>Because the output is code while the human still carries the engineering workflow around it. Quality does not change who performs the transitions.</p></details></div>
228:            <div class="retrieval-quiz__item"><p class="retrieval-quiz__q">3. What is the smallest observable proof that your role has moved?</p><details class="retrieval-quiz__a"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>A system completes at least one meaningful multi-action chain without the human relaying intermediate results, then returns evidence for review.</p></details></div>
232:        <div class="move move--teach">
233:          <p class="move-label">10 · Teach-back prompt</p>
234:          <div class="teach-back">
