726:            <figure class="frame-card">
730:            <figure class="frame-card">
735:          <figure class="frame-card">
743:          <p class="move-label">4 · Name it — Dan term + plain English</p>
745:          <aside class="callout callout--term">
746:            <p class="callout__label">Dan’s term</p>
754:          <p class="move-label">5 · Worked example — trace every line</p>
788:          <p class="move-label">6 · You try — reproduce the A/B test</p>
814:        <div class="move move--fail">
