1046:            <figure class="frame-card">
1050:            <figure class="frame-card">
1056:          <figure class="frame-card">
1063:          <p class="move-label">4 · Name it — Dan term + plain English</p>
1065:          <aside class="callout callout--term">
1066:            <p class="callout__label">Dan’s term</p>
1076:          <p class="move-label">5 · Worked example — all four programmable files</p>
1113:          <p class="move-label">6 · You try — headless reproduction</p>
1126:        <div class="move move--fail">
1127:          <p class="move-label">7 · Common fail + fix</p>
