+
+        <section class="lab-box">
+          <h3 class="lab-box__title">Part 4 · Run an ADW through the orchestrator · 20 points</h3>
+          <pre><code>cd apps/orchestrator_3_stream
+./start_be.sh &amp;   # canonical backend port: 9403
+./start_fe.sh &amp;   # frontend port: 5175
+open "http://127.0.0.1:5175"</code></pre>
+          <ol class="lab-box__steps">
+            <li>Ask: “Start a <code>plan_build_review</code> ADW named <code>lab-orch</code> to add a copy-to-clipboard button to the markdown preview app.”</li>
+            <li>In the event stream, identify the <code>start_adw</code> tool call and returned <code>adw_id</code>.</li>
+            <li>Observe the run in both LOGS and ADWS swimlane views.</li>
+            <li>Ask the orchestrator to check the ADW using its returned ID.</li>
+            <li>From <code>agent_manager.py</code>, list all ten orchestrator tools.</li>
+          </ol>
+          <div class="lab-box__pass">
+            <h4>Pass criteria</h4>
