+              <li>Your ten-tool list contains eight agent-management tools plus <code>start_adw</code> and <code>check_adw</code>.</li>
+              <li>If the UI cannot reach the backend, you check port <code>9403</code> rather than the stale <code>8002</code> found in older notes.</li>
