+          <div class="lab-box__pass">
+            <h4>Pass criteria</h4>
+            <p>You demonstrate REUSE and LEARN, explain ACT → LEARN → REUSE, and state why <code>expertise.yaml</code> is a mental model while the code remains the source of truth.</p>
