+
+        <section class="lab-box">
+          <h3 class="lab-box__title">Part 2 · Read the deterministic ADW spine · 15 points</h3>
+          <ol class="lab-box__steps">
+            <li>Open <code>adws/adw_workflows/adw_plan_build.py</code>.</li>
+            <li>Find <code>TOTAL_STEPS = 2</code>.</li>
+            <li>Find <code>run_plan_step</code> invoking <code>/plan</code> and <code>run_build_step</code> invoking <code>/build</code>.</li>
+            <li>Find <code>create_logging_hooks</code> and <code>create_message_handlers</code>.</li>
+            <li>Open <code>adws/adw_triggers/adw_scripts.py</code> and find the <code>subprocess.Popen</code> call with <code>start_new_session=True</code>.</li>
