+
+        <section class="lab-box">
+          <h3 class="lab-box__title">Part 3 · Run an ADW from the CLI · 15 points</h3>
+          <pre><code>uv run adws/adw_triggers/adw_manual_trigger.py \
+  "lab-feature" \
+  "plan_build" \
+  "Add a word-count badge to the markdown_preview app footer" \
+  "$(pwd)"</code></pre>
+          <ol class="lab-box__steps">
+            <li>Query the newest <code>ai_developer_workflows</code> row and record its name, type, and status.</li>
+            <li>Confirm a plan appeared beneath <code>specs/</code>.</li>
+            <li>Confirm the agent changed <code>apps/markdown_preview</code>; you must not type the application change.</li>
+            <li>Repeat with <code>plan_build_review</code> and confirm an <code>app_review/</code> report ends in PASS or FAIL.</li>
+          </ol>
+          <div class="lab-box__pass">
+            <h4>Pass criteria</h4>
+            <ul class="checklist">
