+              <li>A durable workflow row, plan artifact, application diff, and review verdict are present.</li>
+              <li>Your report records the ADW ID and artifact paths, but no secrets.</li>
+            </ul>
+          </div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section class="lab-box">
+          <h3 class="lab-box__title">Part 4 · Run an ADW through the orchestrator · 20 points</h3>
+          <pre><code>cd apps/orchestrator_3_stream
+./start_be.sh &amp;   # canonical backend port: 9403
+./start_fe.sh &amp;   # frontend port: 5175
+open "http://127.0.0.1:5175"</code></pre>
+          <ol class="lab-box__steps">
